{"memo": "Award Recommendation: Voltara Power Systems Pvt. Ltd.

Recommend award to Voltara Power Systems Pvt. Ltd. at a leveled total of $1,068,250. Voltara's stated total was $994,000; the leveling plugs freight to site (DDP) $20,500, offloading and rigging at site $15,250, startup and commissioning $29,000, and seismic certification $9,500. Helix Switchgear Co outlook lowest stated at $991,500 but levels to $1,088,000 after plugs for integral surge protective device (SPD) $39,500, arc flash and coordination study $19,500, spare parts $15,000, and seismic certification $9,500. Northgate Electric Manufacturing levels at $1,217,000. Voltara is 1.8% below the second-lowest leveled bid.

Before award, clear the unpriced 24-month warranty gap and Voltara's qualifications: pricing is FOB factory, Pune, and equipment warranty is 18 months from shipment. Lead time is 34 weeks."}
